# at its extensionless path (/work serves work.html) and the .html form
# 308-redirects to it. Unmatched paths fall through to /404.html with a 404
# status. No explicit rewrite rules are needed here — adding them creates a
# redirect loop against Pages' built-in canonicalization.
#
